ers.idahocapitalsun.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=medical-marijuana-initiative-hits-snag-ranchers-cheer-grazing-changes-column-building-community-in-pocatello&_bhlid=7f959c5647f68d04d9da80aab03a3ed602dcb648","author":["[[Don Day - BoiseDev Editor]]"],"published":"2026-06-26","created":"2026-07-07","description":"The $1.1 billion expansion of St. Luke’s Regional Medical Center in Boise has reached its highest point, with a topping-out ceremony on a rainy summer Friday. Officials with general contractor Layton Construction and St. Luke’s Health System gathered to watch a crane operator lift a beam topped with a pine tree and an American flag […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},